# Changes to the shape of a project that an upgrade cannot work out for itself.
#
# sdlc_update.sh replaces the invariant layer wholesale, so a file the standard relocates needs no
# entry here: the old path leaves the manifest and is deleted, the new one arrives. This file is
# for the two cases that touch paths the project owns, which that mechanism never looks at.
#
#   move <from> <to>       Relocate a path this project owns. Applied before the new layer is
#                          installed. Refuses rather than merges when <to> already exists.
#
#   promote <from> <to>    A path this project owned becomes part of the standard, at <to>.
#                          An identical local copy is deleted. A local copy that differs stops the
#                          upgrade with a diff, because installing over it would revert a
#                          deliberate edit with no warning and no record. --accept-promotions
#                          proceeds and leaves the copy on disk to port by hand; template-check
#                          fails until it is gone.
#
# Entries are cumulative and append-only: a project three releases behind sees only this copy of
# the file, so removing an entry strands whoever had not yet upgraded past it. Each entry is a
# no-op once <from> is gone, so re-running an upgrade is safe.
#
# Order matters within a kind, and moves are applied before promotions are resolved.

# v3.0.0 — the received layer gathers under .sdlc/upstream/, and the files below stop being the
# project's. Relocations *within* the received layer need no entry: the old path leaves the
# manifest and is deleted, the new one arrives.
promote .sdlc/REVIEW.md .sdlc/upstream/REVIEW.md
promote .sdlc/intent/_TEMPLATE.md .sdlc/upstream/templates/intent.md
promote .sdlc/specs/_TEMPLATE.md .sdlc/upstream/templates/spec.md
promote .sdlc/plans/_TEMPLATE.md .sdlc/upstream/templates/plan.md
promote .sdlc/evals/cases/_EXAMPLE .sdlc/upstream/evals/cases/_EXAMPLE
promote scripts/detect.sh .sdlc/upstream/scripts/detect.sh
promote .claude/hooks/format-on-edit.sh .claude/hooks/format-on-edit.sh
promote .claude/agents/verifier.md .claude/agents/verifier.md
promote .claude/skills/write-intent/SKILL.md .claude/skills/write-intent/SKILL.md
promote .claude/skills/write-spec/SKILL.md .claude/skills/write-spec/SKILL.md
